+/**
+ * Thrown when an owner's postal address is blank once normalized (trimmed,
+ * whitespace-collapsed, upper-cased and with common abbreviations expanded).
+ * Handled by the REST {@code ExceptionControllerAdvice}, which translates it
+ * into a {@code 400 Bad Request} response.
